patch.description:
Update current user. Sending `preferred_locale` as `null` clears it;
omitting it leaves the stored value untouched. `developer_mode` has no
"clear" state, so omitting it leaves the stored value untouched too;
sending it as `null` is rejected as invalid.

get.description:
Get a document node's full view by its ID.

400 if the node exists but is not a document;
404 if the node does not exist in the caller's organisation.
